# Compose UI Rules

- Screens are thin; state from ViewModel via `UiState` + `collectAsStateWithLifecycle`
- Composables are stateless; pass callbacks for events
- Use theme tokens from `ui/theme/Color.kt` (soft palette)
- Game components in `ui/components/game/`, cards in `ui/components/card/`
- Navigation via `AppNavGraph` and `Routes` constants
- All user-facing strings in Russian
- `@Preview` for standalone components

```kotlin
// ✅
@Composable
fun LoginScreen(onLoginClick: () -> Unit, modifier: Modifier = Modifier)

// ❌
@Composable
fun LoginScreen() { viewModel.login() }
```
